WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.036
-My next guests are the stars

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:06.472
of the biggest television show
in the world, "Squid Game."

00:00:06.472 --> 00:00:09.075
It is streaming now on Netflix.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:12.812
Here are Lee Jung-jae,
Park Hae-soo,

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:15.815
Wi Ha-Joon, and Jung Hoyeon!

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:17.016
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.016 --> 00:00:21.420
Welcome! Yes! Yes!

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.490
Welcome, welcome, welcome!

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.458
Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:28.461
Thank you so much
for being here.

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:30.930 line:0%
-[ Speaking native language ]
-Thank you.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.598 line:0%
-Thank you.
-Thank you for having us.

00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:34.166 line:0%
-This is a big deal.

00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:35.568 line:0%
I just want to start.

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:38.037 line:0%
Jung-jae, you're the first one
we meet in the show,

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:41.840 line:0%
and you're so charming
and, like, lovable.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.242 line:0%
We're rooting for you.

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:44.910 line:0%
I know that
you're famous in Korea

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:49.048 line:0%
for mostly playing villains
in a movie.

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:53.519 line:0%
How can that face be a villain?
You're so friendly and likable.

00:00:53.519 --> 00:00:56.155 line:0%
Can you tell everyone
what "Squid Game" is about?

00:00:56.155 --> 00:00:58.124 line:0%
-[ Speaking native language ]

00:01:15.674 --> 00:01:19.912 line:0%
-It's frightening.
It is shocking.

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:22.415 line:0%
But it's also really beautiful,

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:27.153 line:0%
and right now it is number one
on Netflix in 90 countries.

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:28.821 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:28.821 --> 00:01:32.258 line:0%
It is bigger than --

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:38.364 line:0%
Uh, Hae-soo, when did you
realize the show became so big?

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:39.999 line:0%
-Right now.

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:41.134 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:45.071 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:46.773 line:0%
-Right now?
-[ Speaking native language ]

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:49.275 line:0%
Yeah, right now.

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:01.020 line:0%
I want to meet Jimmy...

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.523 line:0%
[ Audience awws ]

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:06.292 line:0%
-That's what I'm talking about.
See? This is...

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.327 line:0%
That's my man.
I love you. Come on.

00:02:08.327 --> 00:02:10.529 line:0%
Oh. I'm so happy.

00:02:10.529 --> 00:02:12.865 line:0%
Ha-Joon, what do you think

00:02:12.865 --> 00:02:15.935 line:0%
people around the world
are connecting to?

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:17.904 line:0%
-Ohh...

00:02:17.904 --> 00:02:20.373 line:0%
[ Speaking native language ]

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:41.994 line:0%
-Yeah, it is --
it's bizarre how --

00:02:41.994 --> 00:02:43.663 line:0%
the combo of that.

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:46.532 line:0%
The children's game,
but also people desperate

00:02:46.532 --> 00:02:48.935 line:0%
kind of to just change
their life and get money.

00:02:48.935 --> 00:02:54.106 line:0%
And they'll do -- And it starts
with the creepiest doll I've --

00:02:54.106 --> 00:02:57.110 line:0%
And I have to show you,
for people who haven't seen.

00:02:57.110 --> 00:03:00.813 line:0%
I got this sent over to us.

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:01.948 line:0%
This came in the mail.

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:03.282 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.282 --> 00:03:06.118 line:0%
This came in the mail for me.
Yeah, thank you so much.

00:03:06.118 --> 00:03:07.620 line:0%
Wait. No.
If you haven't seen this...

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.288 line:0%
Wait. Watch this. This is --

00:03:09.288 --> 00:03:10.890 line:0%
So, this is what --

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.625 line:0%
They played
Red Light, Green Light,

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:15.962 line:0%
but this giant doll
looks at them, okay?

00:03:15.962 --> 00:03:19.565 line:0%
And she says, "Green light,"
and her head is turned around.

00:03:19.565 --> 00:03:21.201 line:0%
When she says, "Red light,"

00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:23.202 line:0%
she turns around,
and her eyes are cameras.

00:03:23.202 --> 00:03:25.437 line:0%
And if you move, you get shot.

00:03:25.437 --> 00:03:27.406 line:0%
[ Laughs ]

00:03:27.406 --> 00:03:28.975 line:0%
But -- I know.

00:03:28.975 --> 00:03:33.579 line:0%
But, also, this robot
is based on a character, right?

00:03:33.579 --> 00:03:35.414 line:0%
From Korean textbooks.

00:03:35.414 --> 00:03:38.317 line:0%
Like, when kids are growing up,
you know who this --

00:03:38.317 --> 00:03:42.355 line:0%
Who is this?
Who is this psycho robot?

00:03:42.355 --> 00:03:44.290 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:50.095 line:0%
-When we were at the school,
there were, like, characters.

00:03:50.095 --> 00:03:53.299 line:0%
One is a boy,
and one is the girl.

00:03:53.299 --> 00:03:56.635 line:0%
The boy's name was Chulsoo,

00:03:56.635 --> 00:03:59.438 line:0%
and the girl's name
was Younghee.

00:03:59.438 --> 00:04:01.240 line:0%
And she's the one.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:02.675 line:0%
-Whew. Yeah.

00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:05.544 line:0%
Jung-jae,
this show is pretty dark,

00:04:05.544 --> 00:04:10.083 line:0%
but your character
is optimistic and funny.

00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:12.017 line:0%
And I was just wondering,
is there anything

00:04:12.017 --> 00:04:14.186 line:0%
that didn't make it to the show
that was --

00:04:14.186 --> 00:04:16.622 line:0%
or maybe things that were in the
show that were improvised?

00:04:16.622 --> 00:04:18.558 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:18.558 --> 00:04:20.393 line:0%
[ Speaking native language ]

00:04:54.326 --> 00:04:56.128 line:0%
-I remember that scene. The --

00:04:56.128 --> 00:04:58.530 line:0%
It's in the first episode.
No spoilers.

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:01.767 line:0%
I'm not giving any spoilers
tonight, so everyone knows.

00:05:01.767 --> 00:05:04.536 line:0%
Hae-soo, you became a dad

00:05:04.536 --> 00:05:06.639 line:0%
the day "Squid Game" premiered.

00:05:06.639 --> 00:05:07.907 line:0%
Is that correct?

00:05:07.907 --> 00:05:10.009 line:0%
[ Applause ]

00:05:10.009 --> 00:05:11.911 line:0%
-[ Speaking native language ]

00:05:42.074 --> 00:05:44.010 line:0%
-Baby Squid.

00:05:45.778 --> 00:05:47.079 line:0%
[ Applause ]

00:05:47.079 --> 00:05:51.650 line:0%
-Yeah! Little Baby Squid!
How cute! Come on!

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:55.654 line:0%
I want to show everyone
a clip from the show.

00:05:55.654 --> 00:05:58.390 line:0%
This is "Squid Game."
Take a look.

00:05:58.390 --> 00:06:01.794 line:0%
-♪ In other words ♪

00:06:01.794 --> 00:06:06.199 line:0%
♪ Darling, kiss me ♪

00:06:06.199 --> 00:06:08.601 line:0%
♪ Fill my heart with song ♪

00:06:08.601 --> 00:06:13.605 line:0%
♪ And let me sing forever more ♪

00:06:13.605 --> 00:06:16.309 line:0%
♪ You are all I long for ♪

00:06:16.309 --> 00:06:20.279 line:0%
♪ All I worship and adore ♪

00:06:20.279 --> 00:06:23.249 line:0%
♪ In other words ♪

00:06:23.249 --> 00:06:27.286 line:0%
♪ Please be true ♪

00:06:27.286 --> 00:06:30.155 line:0%
♪ In other words ♪

00:06:30.155 --> 00:06:33.091 line:0%
[ Music stops ]

00:06:33.091 --> 00:06:35.294 line:0%
-[ Breathing sharply ]

00:06:35.294 --> 00:06:36.996 line:0%
-Ohh!

00:06:36.996 --> 00:06:38.630 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:41.267 line:0%
He saved you! I love it!

00:06:41.267 --> 00:06:43.569 line:0%
The cast of "Squid Game,"
everybody!

00:06:43.569 --> 00:06:45.571 line:0%
The show is streaming now
on Netflix.

